WEBVTT

NOTE label

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:02.500
This DVD is invented.
Its teaching is not.

NOTE label

00:00:02.525 --> 00:00:05.300
It comes from real
ministries' booklets
and courses,
1987–2016.

NOTE label

00:00:05.325 --> 00:00:07.600
Every reason in it
was taught to
real women.

NOTE label

00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:09.500
You can stop it
at any time.

NOTE End of Part 1 (the card holds to the end of its chapter)

00:01:06.292 --> 00:01:17.490
HEARTWOOD · MEMBER WORKBOOK · p. 31
Session Two · The Roots
Pause the DVD here.
TALK IT THROUGH · 10 minutes
1. Look at the tree on page 22. What is in your soil?
2. Which of the Big Three do you recognise in your own story?
3. Pray for one another before you press play.

NOTE break (the booklet's own words)

00:03:13.634 --> 00:03:17.342
“Prepare for grief
and depression.”

NOTE break (the booklet's own words)

00:03:17.692 --> 00:03:21.460
“…as painful as
going through
a divorce.”

NOTE break

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:25.662
It asked women to
end their closest
friendships.

NOTE break

00:03:26.012 --> 00:03:29.720
To throw away
the songs they
shared.

NOTE break

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:34.138
To confess their
feelings, and be
asked about them
again and again.

NOTE break

00:03:34.488 --> 00:03:38.376
To look for
the cause in their
mothers and fathers.

NOTE break

00:03:38.726 --> 00:03:42.830
When the feelings
stayed, it said
they had not truly
wanted to change.

NOTE break

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:47.032
In June 2016 it
was still sold
in packs of five.
